e pied tourné vers la sortie dit le mouvement : « sortir ». Dans la forme actuelle, ce dessin est devenu deux 山 superposés, qui ne sont plus des montagnes.","en":"On oracle bones, 出 shows a foot, 止, stepping out of a pit or a dug-out dwelling, drawn as a hollow open at the top. The foot pointing toward the way out conveys the movement: “to go out”. In the current form the drawing has turned into two stacked 山, which are no longer mountains.","roles":{}}},"初":{"c":"初","pinyin":"chū","lectures":["chū"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["衤","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0102","L3-0103","L3-0104","L3-0105","L3-0106","L3-0137","L3-0510","L4-0997","L5-0126","L6-0147","L7-0561","L7-0562","L7-3207","L7-5159"],"chemin":{"hsk":365,"lire":361},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"début ; premier ; au début","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Prefix","fr":"préfixe des premiers jours du mois lunaire : chūyī"},{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"au début, pour la première fois"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"début (d'une période)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"今天是初一。","pinyin":"Jīntiān shì chūyī.","fr":"Aujourd'hui, c'est le premier jour du mois lunaire.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我们是月初来的。","pinyin":"Wǒmen shì yuè chū lái de.","fr":"Nous sommes arrivés au début du mois.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"厨":{"c":"厨","pinyin":"chú","lectures":["chú"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["厂","豆","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0129","L6-0149"],"chemin":{"hsk":628,"lire":621},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cuisine (pièce) ; cuisinier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"cuisine (la pièce) ; cuisinier"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他是这家饭店的厨师。","pinyin":"Tā shì zhè jiā fàndiàn de chúshī.","fr":"Il est cuisinier dans ce restaurant.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"橱":{"c":"橱","pinyin":"chú","lectures":["chú"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","厂","豆","寸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3801"],"chemin":{"hsk":959,"lire":952},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"armoire, placard","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"armoire, placard, vitrine"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"除":{"c":"除","pinyin":"chú","lectures":["chú"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["阝","人","干","小"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0107","L5-0089","L5-0127","L5-0128","L5-0399","L5-0539","L5-0835","L6-0148","L7-0563","L7-0564","L7-0565","L7-1106","L7-2331","L7-2438","L7-2867","L7-3162","L7-3299","L7-3336","L7-3385","L7-3521","L7-3546","L7-4050","L7-5238"],"chemin":{"hsk":356,"lire":352},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ôter, enlever ; sauf, excepté","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"ôter, enlever, supprimer"},{"categorie":"Prep","fr":"sauf, excepté"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"diviser (en calcul)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"除了你，没人知道。","pinyin":"Chúle nǐ, méi rén zhīdào.","fr":"À part toi, personne n'est au courant.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"储":{"c":"储","pinyin":"chǔ","lectures":["chǔ"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","讠","耂","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0150","L7-0569","L7-0570"],"chemin":{"hsk":769,"lire":762},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"stocker, mettre en réserve","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"stocker, mettre en réserve, épargner"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"楚":{"c":"楚","pinyin":"chǔ","lectures":["chǔ"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","木","乛","龰"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0440"],"chemin":{"hsk":229,"lire":239},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"clair, net ; douleur","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"clair, net"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"douleur, souffrance"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 楚 par « buisson », l'arbuste qu'on appelle aussi 荆 : 林, deux arbres, et 疋 pour le son. On lit toujours 林 en haut ; 疋, en bas, se lit shū et ne donne plus le son de chǔ. Des verges qu'on coupait dans ces buissons est venue la douleur ; « clair » vient d'un autre emploi.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 楚 as “thicket”, the shrub also called 荆: 林, two trees, and 疋 for the sound. You still read 林 on top; 疋, below, is read shū and no longer gives the sound of chǔ. The rods cut from these thickets gave the meaning of pain; “clear” comes from another use.","roles":{}}},"础":{"c":"础","pinyin":"chǔ","lectures":["chǔ"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["石","出"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0316"],"chemin":{"hsk":356,"lire":353},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"socle, base (d'une colonne)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"socle, base (d'une colonne)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"处":{"c":"处","pinyin":"chù","lectures":["chù","chǔ"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["夂","卜"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0110","L2-0215","L2-0237","L3-0077","L3-0108","L3-0161","L4-0111","L4-0112","L4-0797","L5-0130","L5-0131","L5-0132","L5-0666","L5-0941","L6-0010","L6-0151","L6-0152","L6-0165","L6-0769","L6-0983","L7-0368","L7-0465","L7-0566","L7-0567","L7-0568","L7-1617","L7-1624","L7-2964","L7-3058","L7-3232","L7-3386","L7-3958","L7-4970","L7-5269","L7-5466"],"chemin":{"hsk":230,"lire":239},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"endroit ; service ; traiter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"endroit, lieu ; service, bureau"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"traiter, régler ; vivre avec","pinyin":"chǔ"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这是我们的住处。","pinyin":"Zhè shì wǒmen de zhùchù.","fr":"C'est là que nous logeons.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 処 et le glose « s'arrêter » : 夂, les pas, qui trouvent un tabouret, 几. S'arrêter, c'est demeurer quelque part : de là « l'endroit », lu chù, et « vivre avec, traiter », lu chǔ. La forme simplifiée garde 夂 et remplace 几 par 卜.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 処 and glosses it as “to stop”: 夂, footsteps, reaching a stool, 几. Stopping is staying somewhere: hence “place”, read chù, and “to live with, to deal with”, read chǔ. The simplified form keeps 夂 and replaces 几 with 卜.","roles":{"夂":"sens","卜":"forme"}}},"畜":{"c":"畜","pinyin":"chù","lectures":["chù","xù"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亠","幺","田"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-3663"],"chemin":{"hsk":959,"lire":952},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bétail ; élever","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"animal domestique, bétail"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"élever (des animaux)","pinyin":"xù"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"触":{"c":"触","pinyin":"chù","lectures":["chù"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["角","虫"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0397","L7-0571","L7-0572","L7-0573","L7-0574","L7-0575","L7-0819","L7-1258"],"chemin":{"hsk":628,"lire":621},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"toucher ; émouvoir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"toucher, entrer en contact"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"émouvoir, toucher (le cœur)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"请不要触摸展品。","pinyin":"Qǐng bùyào chùmō zhǎnpǐn.","fr":"Merci de ne pas toucher les objets exposés.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"揣":{"c":"揣","pinyin":"chuāi","lectures":["chuāi","chuǎi","chuài"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","山","而"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0576","L7-0577","L7-0578"],"chemin":{"hsk":960,"lire":953},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"glisser sous ses vêtements ; supputer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"glisser sous ses vêtements, empocher"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"supputer, estimer","pinyin":"chuǎi"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他把钱揣在怀里。","pinyin":"Tā bǎ qián chuāi zài huái li.","fr":"Il a glissé l'argent contre sa poitrine.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"踹":{"c":"踹","pinyin":"chuài","lectures":["chuài"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","止","山","而"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0579"],"chemin":{"hsk":960,"lire":953},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"donner un coup de pied","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"donner un coup de pied"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他一脚把门踹开了。","pinyin":"Tā yī jiǎo bǎ mén chuài kāi le.","fr":"Il a enfoncé la porte du pied.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"川":{"c":"川","pinyin":"chuān","lectures":["chuān"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L7-0580","L7-3539"],"chemin":{"hsk":285,"lire":289},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rivière ; plaine","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"rivière, cours d'eau ; plaine"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"穿":{"c":"穿","pinyin":"chuān","lectures":["chuān"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["穴","牙"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0051","L4-0113","L7-0581","L7-0582","L7-0583","L7-0584","L7-1472"],"chemin":{"hsk":219,"lire":226},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"mettre, porter (un vêtement)","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"mettre, porter : vêtements, chaussures"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"traverser, percer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"今天很冷，多穿点儿衣服。","pinyin":"Jīntiān hěn lěng, duō chuān diǎnr yīfu.","fr":"Il fait froid aujourd'hui, couvre-toi bien.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 穿 par « percer de part en part » et le décrit comme des dents, 牙, dans un trou, 穴. On lit toujours 穴 en haut et 牙 en bas. De percer un passage, on est passé à y glisser le corps : 穿 veut dire aussi « enfiler un vêtement ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 穿 as “to pierce through” and describes it as teeth, 牙, in a hole, 穴. You still read 穴 at the top and 牙 at the bottom. From boring a passage, the meaning moved to slipping one's body through: 穿 also means “to put on clothes”.","roles":{"穴":"sens","牙":"sens"}}},"传":{"c":"传","pinyin":"chuán","lectures":["chuán","zhuàn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","专"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0109","L3-0110","L3-0111","L3-0112","L3-0818","L4-0114","L4-0489","L4-0874","L5-0133","L5-0134","L5-0135","L6-0153","L6-0154","L6-0155","L6-0156","L7-0585","L7-0586","L7-0587","L7-0588","L7-0589","L7-0590","L7-0591","L7-3676","L7-4515","L7-5499","L7-5500","L7-5610"],"chemin":{"hsk":357,"lire":353},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"transmettre, répandre ; biographie","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"transmettre, passer ; se répandre"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"biographie, chronique","pinyin":"zhuàn"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"请把球传给我。","pinyin":"Qǐng bǎ qiú chuán gěi wǒ.","fr":"Passe-moi le ballon, s'il te plaît.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"船":{"c":"船","pinyin":"chuán","lectures":["chuán"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["舟","几","口"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0077","L3-0299","L4-0496","L6-0157","L6-0158","L6-0159","L6-0272","L7-0592","L7-0593","L7-1037","L7-3868","L7-5065","L7-5094"],"chemin":{"hsk":262,"lire":268},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bateau, navire","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"bateau, navire"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我们坐船去吧。","pinyin":"Wǒmen zuò chuán qù ba.","fr":"Allons-y en bateau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 船 par « bateau » : 舟, le bateau, et une partie de 鉛 pour le son. On lit toujours 舟 à gauche. À droite, 几 sur 口 ne donne plus le son de chuán : 舟 suffit à dire le sens.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 船 as “boat”: 舟, the boat, and part of 鉛 for the sound. You still read 舟 on the left. On the right, 几 over 口 no longer gives the sound of chuán: 舟 is enough to carry the meaning.","roles":{"舟":"sens","几":"forme","口":"forme"}}},"喘":{"c":"喘","pinyin":"chuǎn","lectures":["chuǎn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","山","而"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0594","L7-0595"],"chemin":{"hsk":961,"lire":954},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"haleter, être essoufflé","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"haleter, être essoufflé"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他跑得直喘。","pinyin":"Tā pǎo de zhí chu