ut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : 广, un toit adossé à un mur, abrite 木, le bois. Un meuble de bois sous le toit de la maison, c'est le lit. Il ferme aussi la journée : 起床, c'est se lever, 上床, se coucher.","en":"As a memory aid: 广, a roof leaning against a wall, shelters 木, wood. A wooden piece of furniture under the roof of the house is the bed. It frames the day too: 起床 is getting up, 上床 going to bed.","roles":{"广":"sens","木":"sens"}}},"闯":{"c":"闯","pinyin":"chuǎng","lectures":["chuǎng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["门","马"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0137"],"chemin":{"hsk":629,"lire":622},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"foncer, faire irruption ; s'aventurer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"foncer, faire irruption"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"s'aventurer, tenter sa chance (dans la vie)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他一个人去大城市闯一闯。","pinyin":"Tā yī ge rén qù dà chéngshì chuǎng yī chuǎng.","fr":"Il part seul tenter sa chance dans une grande ville.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"创":{"c":"创","pinyin":"chuàng","lectures":["chuàng","chuāng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["人","㔾","刂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0113","L3-0114","L3-0115","L3-0116","L5-0138","L6-0162","L6-0163","L6-0164","L6-0493","L7-0597","L7-0599","L7-0600","L7-3782","L7-5139","L7-5430"],"chemin":{"hsk":357,"lire":354},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"créer, fonder ; blessure","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"créer, fonder, établir"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"blessure","pinyin":"chuāng"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他创了一个新纪录。","pinyin":"Tā chuàng le yī ge xīn jìlù.","fr":"Il a établi un nouveau record.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"吹":{"c":"吹","pinyin":"chuī","lectures":["chuī"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0078","L7-0601","L7-0602","L7-0603"],"chemin":{"hsk":230,"lire":240},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"souffler ; se vanter","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"souffler ; jouer d'un instrument à vent"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"se vanter, fanfaronner"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"风吹走了我的纸。","pinyin":"Fēng chuī zǒu le wǒ de zhǐ.","fr":"Le vent a emporté ma feuille.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"别吹了！","pinyin":"Bié chuī le!","fr":"Arrête de te vanter !","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 吹 par « expirer » et l'écrit avec 口, la bouche, et 欠, l'homme bouche ouverte. On le lit tel quel : 口 à gauche, 欠 à droite. Deux bouches qui soufflent : souffler, jouer d'un instrument à vent, et se vanter.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 吹 as “to breathe out” and writes it with 口, the mouth, and 欠, a man with his mouth open. You read it as it is: 口 on the left, 欠 on the right. Two mouths blowing: to blow, to play a wind instrument, and to boast.","roles":{"口":"sens","欠":"sens"}}},"炊":{"c":"炊","pinyin":"chuī","lectures":["chuī"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["火","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4852"],"chemin":{"hsk":961,"lire":954},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"cuisiner","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"cuisiner, faire cuire"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"垂":{"c":"垂","pinyin":"chuí","lectures":["chuí"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L7-0604","L7-0605"],"chemin":{"hsk":204,"lire":221},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pendre, laisser pendre ; baisser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"pendre, laisser pendre ; baisser"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他垂着头，一句话也不说。","pinyin":"Tā chuí zhe tóu, yī jù huà yě bù shuō.","fr":"La tête basse, il ne dit pas un mot.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"捶":{"c":"捶","pinyin":"chuí","lectures":["chuí"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","垂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0606"],"chemin":{"hsk":962,"lire":955},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"frapper du poing, marteler","acceptions":[